Changes made by this fork (branch: combocraft-rebrand):

- Rebranded to "ComboCraft World Builder" (package name, product name,
  Tauri identifier).
- Removed all telemetry: upstream sent opt-in crash reports, logs and
  click events to https://arnismc.com/telemetry/report_telemetry.php.
  This fork ships a no-op telemetry stub and the related GUI
  toggles/modals were removed. No data leaves the app.
- Removed upstream's private Overpass instance (api.arnismc.com) from
  the server rotation; only public Overpass mirrors are used.
- Update check points to this fork's repository instead of
  louis-e/arnis.
- Custom 3D archetype models (stadium/plane), which upstream downloads
  at runtime from arnismc.com, are disabled; affected structures render
  procedurally. They can be re-enabled via the
  COMBOCRAFT_CUSTOM_MODELS_URL_BASE environment variable pointing at
  your own model host.
- The in-game spawn branding map image (assets/branding/arnismc_map.png)
  was replaced with ComboCraft branding.

The Luanti block-name mapping in src/luanti_block_map.rs remains derived
from MC2MT by rollerozxa (GNU LGPL v2.1+), as noted in that file.

